WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:04,580
Ms. Lei, the results are out. Thank you.

2
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:05,580
Get out of here

3
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:14,820
Rainbow Dash, I want you to get out of here.

4
00:00:37,930 --> 00:00:39,930
Baby, your eyes look like mine

5
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:41,930
I have a lot of hair too. How about removing spots?

6
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:45,730
Really more like that dog

7
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:47,730
A baby is not like a dog

8
00:00:49,020 --> 00:00:50,020
Have you finished your research?

9
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:52,020
I sneezed ten times in half an hour

10
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:54,020
Baby, mommy has something to do tonight

11
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:55,020
Can I pick you up tomorrow?

12
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:05,980
Okay, mom is not going

13
00:01:05,980 --> 00:01:06,980
mother with baby

14
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:20,770
Sit tight. The baby stops crying.

15
00:01:20,770 --> 00:01:21,770
Uncle will wait for us to go home again
